---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant ControlDB as Control DB
    participant ExecDB as Execution DBs

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo run status
    activate Vigilo
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Parse run id
    Vigilo->>ControlDB: Load run and execution routes
    ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Run snapshot and route list

    alt Run loaded
        Vigilo->>ExecDB: Read shard summaries where available
        ExecDB-->>Vigilo: Live progress summaries
        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Mark whether status is terminal
        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Build status payload with live_progress
        Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    else Run lookup fails
        Vigilo-->>User: Status error
    end
    deactivate Vigilo
